# iOS 27 on the Galaxy S9 (STARLTE, Exynos 9810): Apple's xnu-12377.121.6 (ac9718fb1af6), pristine, then these, in order
# (xnu/apply-series.sh, selected by profiles/ios-27.conf). One block, from three layers and Scion's changes:
#   - darwin-xnu-build's edits to the tree and its own patches (blacktop, MIT): starlte/blacktop/
#   - ios-sweet (dipa-studio, MIT) 0003-0081, ios-a5xelte (orhunnx and A5XELTE contributors, MIT) 0082-0128, the Galaxy S7 layer
#     (wardevsa; used and published with the author's permission) 0200-0238, and the Starbite author's STARLTE port 0300-0398:
#     starlte/ (its README.md says how each patch was ported to xnu-12377)
#   - Scion's: 0120 (Darwin 27's system calls, the same file as the ios-26 series) and starlte/0400 and up
# Lines ending .sh are run in the tree's root with MACHINE_CONFIG (the profile's) and MACOS_VERSION=26.5: they stage Apple's HFS,
# libpthread and BearSSL by commit, and take CoreEntitlements' headers from the Kernel Debug Kit you bring (KDKROOT).
# The drivers are this series': it carries the ones it booted with (docs/ios27-starlte.md has the plan to take them from drivers/).
# drivers: series
# imports: none
starlte/blacktop/10_dxb_build_seds.sh
starlte/0019-stage-libpthread.sh
starlte/0020-stage-bearssl.sh
starlte/0026-stage-hfs.sh
starlte/blacktop/00_setup_coreentitlements.sh
# what the series adds as files (xnu/files-12377/, the tree's own layout): after the staging above, before the patches that hook them in
files xnu/files-12377
# Scion's own driver files, from where they live in this repository (drivers/, socs/, xnu/files/), byte for byte as the series booted with them
copy drivers/soc/exynos/hakios.exynos_hsi2c.c bsd/dev/hakios.exynos_hsi2c.c
copy drivers/usb/hakios.exynos_usb.c bsd/dev/hakios.exynos_usb.c
copy drivers/usb/hakios.usb_acm.h bsd/dev/hakios.usb_acm.h
copy drivers/usb/hakios.usb_glue.h bsd/dev/hakios.usb_glue.h
copy socs/exynos9810/include/hakios.exynos9810_soc.h bsd/sys/hakios.exynos9810_soc.h
copy xnu/files/bsd/sys/hakios.exynos_acpm.h bsd/sys/hakios.exynos_acpm.h
copy xnu/files/bsd/sys/hakios.exynos_hsi2c.h bsd/sys/hakios.exynos_hsi2c.h
copy xnu/files/bsd/sys/hakios.exynos_pcie.h bsd/sys/hakios.exynos_pcie.h
copy xnu/files/bsd/sys/hakios.input.h bsd/sys/hakios.input.h
copy xnu/files/bsd/sys/hakios.log.h bsd/sys/hakios.log.h
copy xnu/files/bsd/sys/hakios.scion_gov.h bsd/sys/hakios.scion_gov.h
copy xnu/files/bsd/sys/hakios.xnu.h bsd/sys/hakios.xnu.h

